00:17:09,070 --> 00:17:09,960
Rồi, rồi, rồi.

355
00:17:09,970 --> 00:17:10,810
Không phải.

356
00:17:10,940 --> 00:17:13,300
Cô làm phòng tranh y hệt cái chợ vậy,

357
00:17:13,300 --> 00:17:14,860
